00:29:55.620 --> 00:30:06.240
<v David Boskovic>Making decisions quickly and being confident that any decision you make here that you are willing to stand behind and willing to keep testing is good enough.

484
00:30:06.640 --> 00:30:10.820
<v David Boskovic>Taking time and agonizing over and second guessing yourself is just going to waste more time.

